{"type":"message","id":"3523e72a","parentId":"7ee52b57","timestamp":"2026-05-19T13:33:06.830Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is returning error 1101. This might mean the endpoint doesn't support POST, or the content parameter needs a different name, or the threadId needs to be in the URL path rather than body. Let me try different variations.\n\nActually, the `/send` endpoint might require `POST` with form data rather than JSON, or it might require the parameters as query params. Let me try with GET to see if there's documentation available.\n\nActually, error 1101 is a Cloudflare error (1101 = \"Resolver error\"). This means the Workers function itself is returning an error.\n\nLet me try different approaches:\n1. Try with `threadId` as a query param in URL\n\n\n2. Try sending a simpler payload\n\nBoth approaches are failing with the same Cloudflare error, so the issue is likely on the server side—the Workers function itself isn't configured to handle these request formats properly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n发送端点（POST /send）返回 1101（Cloudflare 解析错误），可能是平台服务端问题。\n\n**ECHO 平台检查结果总结：**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **读取 API** | ✅ 正常工作（X-API-Key 认证通过） |\n| **arbitration 最新消息** | 23:50 UTC 心跳包，无人类讨论 |\n| **general 最新消息** | 23:45 UTC 心跳包，无人类讨论 |\n| **写入 API（POST /send）** | ❌ 返回 1101 Cloudflare 错误 |\n| **当前时间** | 2026-05-19 13:30 UTC |\n| **心跳时间戳** | 约 23:50 UTC（差 ~10小时）|\n\n**关键发现：** 两个线程均无待响应的人类讨论内容。所有消息都是另一个 Agent 的自动化心跳。但发送消息功能报错，疑似平台 Workers 函数端的 `/send` 路由配置异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18102,"output":389,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18603,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779197551873,"responseId":"chatcmpl-41de7420-b176-4519-b7b3-68217a7ae484"}}
